  "rationale": "The workflow already implements the key evidence-supported optimizations: dependency caching via setup-python's cache: pip/npm on every Python/Node job, and concurrency with cancel-in-progress for stale-run suppression. The remaining candidate patterns either would reduce intended matrix test coverage (P-LIT-FAIL-FAST on playwright-sqlite and postgresql, where each browser/version/binding combination is a distinct required diagnostic outcome) or are not applicable (P-LIT-CUSTOM-TIMEOUT would lower the 60-minute test-suite timeouts to values that break valid runs; P-LIT-CANCEL-STALE is already covered by the existing concurrency group). No supported optimization preserves intended coverage while adding measurable benefit.",
